{"site": {"id": "26-jumeirah-english-speaking-school-jess", "name": "Jumeirah English Speaking School (JESS)", "type": "School", "country": "UAE", "region": "Middle East", "curriculum": "British / IB", "ownership": "Non-profit", "url": "https://www.jess.sch.ae", "client": false}, "pages": [{"url": "https://www.jess.sch.ae/", "title": "Home - Jess Dubai", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[13.3, "div", 30, 1, 1, "Working at Jess"], [13.3, "div", 30, 1, 1, "PARENT PORTAL"], [20, "p", 981, 0, 0, "THREE SCHOOLS, TWO SITES, ONE JESS"], [52, "h2", 1026, 0, 0, "Director’s Welcome"], [16, "p", 1150, 0, 0, "It is a privilege to lead this remarkable school community and to build upon the strong foundations and outstanding reputation that JESS has established over more than fifty years. From the moment you walk onto the JESS campuses, you are struck by the warmth of the relationships, the sense of belonging, and the shared commitment to ensuring that every student flourishes."], [16, "p", 1291, 0, 0, "At JESS, academic excellence is important, but it is only part of the story. We are committed to developing confident, compassionate and curious young people who are equipped not only for success in their studies, but also to make a positive contribution to the world around them. Our vision of Educating to Make a Difference in the World is more than a statement; it is reflected in the daily experiences of our students and staff and in the culture that makes JESS such a special place."], [16, "p", 1457, 0, 0, "Our values of Commitment, Respect, Care, Integrity, Curiosity and Excellence guide everything we do. They shape the character of our community, influence our decisions, and help our students develop the confidence and resilience to embrace opportunities, overcome challenges and lead with purpose."], [16, "p", 1573, 0, 0, "At JESS we believe that every child has unique talents and the potential to achieve great things when supported, challenged and inspired. The JESS commitment is to ensure that every member of our community is known, valued and encouraged to discover their strengths, pursue their passions and become the very best version of themselves. JESS has a proud history as a not-for-profit school, placing the needs of students at the heart of every decision. The strength of our partnership between students, parents, staff and governors is one of our greatest assets."], [16, "p", 1764, 0, 0, "Thank you for taking the time to learn more about JESS. Whether you are a current family, a prospective parent, a student or a member of our wider community, I hope this website provides a glimpse into the ambition, care, achievement and sense of purpose that define life at JESS."], [16, "p", 1880, 0, 0, "I look forward to welcoming you to our school."], [60, "h5", 1961, 0, 0, "Rebecca Glover"], [22, "div", 2037, 0, 0, "DIRECTOR"], [52, "h2", 2195, 0, 0, "JESS Life"], [16, "p", 2458, 0, 0, "At JESS we are committed to supporting students to achieve beyond their own beliefs. Students are encouraged to discover their passion in pursuit of excellence. Learning and teaching opportunities inspire students to be curious and strive to make a difference in the world. Learning is centred around strong community relationships built on trust."], [16, "p", 2603, 0, 0, "Our inspiring academic, sport, performing arts and enrichment environments strive to support our students to have resilience, reflectivity and empathy to flourish and lead change."], [13.3, "div", 2708, 0, 0, "Find Out More"], [52, "h2", 3024, 0, 0, "An Educational Journey"], [16, "div", 3259, 0, 0, "JESS has educated boys and girls from ages 3 to 18 since 1976. Our diverse community includes staff and students from over 70 countries. From humble beginnings, JESS has become one of the region’s most trusted schools, combining community warmth with educational excellence. We are a high-achieving, inclusive, not-for-profit school that places students at the centre of every decision. Consistently rated ‘Outstanding’ by the Dubai School Inspection Bureau, JESS ranks among the top 15 private schools in the Middle East and top 100 globally."], [16, "p", 3799, 0, 0, "3-11 YEARS OLD"], [34, "h3", 3832, 0, 0, "Early Years and Primary"], [16, "p", 3886, 0, 0, "Placing your child at the heart of all learning is the theme throughout the Early Years and Primary Education at JESS."], [13.3, "div", 3966, 0, 0, "LEARN MORE"], [16, "p", 4374, 0, 0, "11-18 YEARS OLD"], [34, "h3", 4407, 0, 0, "Secondary and Sixth Form"], [16, "div", 4461, 0, 0, "Individual Learning and innovative programmes ensure JESS Secondary and Sixth Form students make a positive difference."], [52, "h2", 4913, 0, 0, "Community"], [20, "div", 5030, 0, 0, "News and events"], [52, "h2", 6623, 0, 0, "Always Guided by Our Values"]], "links": [["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "About JESS"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "The JESS Ethos"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-story/", "The JESS Story"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/governance/", "Governance"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/inspections-and-accreditations/", "Inspections & Accreditations"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/examination-results/", "Examination Results"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/university-and-careers/", "University & Careers"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/our-people/", "Our People"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/jess-and-the-uae/", "JESS & the UAE"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/al-ajyaal-programme/", "Al Ajyaal Programme"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/policies-and-procedures/", "Policies & Procedures"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "About JESS"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "The JESS Ethos"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-story/", "The JESS Story"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/governance/", "Governance"], ["https://www.je