 Careers"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/our-people/", "Our People"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/jess-and-the-uae/", "JESS & the UAE"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/al-ajyaal-programme/", "Al Ajyaal Programme"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/policies-and-procedures/", "Policies & Procedures"], ["https://www.instagram.com/p/DeYYP5AF4on", "Likes Count 140 Meet Alexia, Secondary Head Girl. A great school is about more t"], ["https://www.instagram.com/p/DeQp8UBF4RT", "Likes Count 74 We were delighted to welcome Theory of Knowledge teachers from ac"]], "skipped": [["script @script.#", 54038], ["style @style.#", 4904], ["script @script.#divi-custom-script-js-extra", 1625], ["nav @nav.et-menu-nav#", 1030], ["style @style.#dtq-et-icons-all", 990], ["script @script.#swp-live-search-client-js-extra", 936], ["noscript @noscript.#", 862], ["script @script.#et-builder-modules-script-sticky-js-extra", 762]], "sample": "", "role": "home"}, {"url": "https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "title": "The JESS Ethos - Jess Dubai", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[13.3, "div", 30, 1, 1, "Working at Jess"], [13.3, "div", 30, 1, 1, "PARENT PORTAL"], [62, "h1", 756, 1, 0, "The JESS Ethos"], [52, "h2", 938, 0, 0, "Our Vision"], [18, "p", 1018, 0, 0, "Educating to make a difference in the world"], [16, "p", 1057, 0, 0, "The notion of ‘Making A Difference’ resonates strongly in everything we do and on every level. Our vision does not make claims of greatness but reflects a humble determination that the actions we take are considered and have a positive impact on a friend, family, movement, or oneself. Our vision broadens to be effective on a global level. We are so proud of the young people that exit our gates at the end of their JESS education. We want them to leave confident and determined to Make A Difference in the World"], [52, "h2", 1442, 0, 0, "Our Mission"], [18, "li", 1524, 0, 0, "Discovering brilliance in every individual"], [18, "li", 1550, 0, 0, "Building community through respect and a sense of belonging"], [18, "li", 1576, 0, 0, "Empowering people to act with purpose"], [16, "p", 1633, 0, 0, "Our mission focuses on our responsibility for every child, developing their gifts and abilities whilst supporting their every need. The sentiments of respect and belonging at JESS are a focus and priority. Giving our young people the tools and confidence to act in a meaningful way will pull all these strands together to realise our overarching vision. By sending our young people out into the world, well prepared and determined to make a difference, JESS will have done its job well."], [52, "h2", 2014, 0, 0, "Our Core Values"], [16, "p", 2094, 0, 0, "The JESS Core Values embody the JESS culture of nurture and aspiration. Each statement is carefully worded to allow them to be applicable and transferable in any situation. Our Core Values provide an important reference point to enable JESS to achieve its vision of Making A Difference in the world."], [18, "p", 2385, 0, 0, "COMMITMENT"], [16, "p", 2424, 0, 0, "We are dedicated and persevere in every undertaking"], [18, "p", 2385, 0, 0, "RESPECT"], [16, "div", 2424, 0, 0, "We embrace differences and celebrate our unique identities"], [18, "div", 2385, 0, 0, "EXCELLENCE"], [16, "div", 2424, 0, 0, "High expectations drive all that we do"], [18, "div", 2385, 0, 0, "CARE"], [16, "div", 2424, 0, 0, "We act with empathy and compassion towards people and our planet"], [18, "div", 2385, 0, 0, "INTEGRITY"], [16, "div", 2424, 0, 0, "We do the right thing, even when faced with difficult decisions"], [18, "div", 2385, 0, 0, "CURIOSITY"], [16, "p", 2424, 0, 0, "We are excited to learn and have the courage to explore"], [52, "h2", 2706, 0, 0, "Not for Profit"], [16, "p", 2786, 0, 0, "Integrity is one of the six Core Values at JESS and possibly the most relevant when describing the trust and reputation the school has garnered as it has grown and matured. This is in no small part due to the approach the school strictly adheres to."], [16, "p", 2852, 0, 0, "JESS is a not-for-profit school meaning it is governed by a Board of unpaid trustees, most of whom are JESS parents, past or present, whose sole interest is to oversee the quality of education delivered and the development and direction of the school. Every dirham received is channelled straight back into the school to realise its goals."], [16, "p", 2943, 0, 0, "This commitment has driven the school to great heights. People new to JESS say that you can feel the not-for-profit difference immediately. The Board of Governors, the JESS Executive and staff hold this ethos as an absolute priority."], [52, "h2", 3155, 0, 0, "Our Strategy"], [18, "p", 3235, 0, 0, "JESS has a clear strategy to achieve it’s Vision and Mission."]], "links": [["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "About JESS"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "The JESS Ethos"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-story/", "The JESS Story"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/governance/", "Governance"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/inspections-and-accreditations/", "Inspections & Accreditations"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/examination-results/", "Examination Results"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/university-and-careers/", "University & Careers"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/our-people/", "Our People"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/jess-and-the-uae/", "JESS & the UAE"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/al-ajyaal-programme/", "Al Ajyaal Programme"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/policies-and-procedures/", "Policies & Procedures"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "About JESS"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-ethos/", "The JESS Ethos"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/the-jess-story/", "The JESS Story"], ["https://www.jess.sch.ae/about-jess/governance/", "Governance"], ["https:/